t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-612144d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"612144d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A gravel road winds through the mountains and deep into the jungle. As on any road trip, there are\u00a0 great things to see along the way. From small towns to wild monkeys, this trip offers a great glimpse into life in the Peruvian jungle.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3edf9fd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3edf9fd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Highlights<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a9a3ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3a9a3ac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Travel in a private 4\u00d74 pick up truck, looking for animals and stopping in small towns,\u00a0 swim in a small river, visit clay lick platform, nature hike, birdwatching.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-ba3a917 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"ba3a917\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-52c5f3a\" data-id=\"52c5f3